       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYMENT.
      *
      * PAYMENT PROCESSING MODULE
      *
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PAYMENT-AMT     PIC 9(7)V99.
       01  WS-CUSTOMER-ID     PIC 9(8).
       01  WS-STATUS-CODE     PIC XX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       PROCESS-PAYMENT.
           DISPLAY "PROCESSING PAYMENT..."
           ACCEPT WS-CUSTOMER-ID
           ACCEPT WS-PAYMENT-AMT

           PERFORM VALIDATE-PAYMENT
           IF WS-STATUS-CODE = "OK"
               PERFORM APPLY-PAYMENT
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "PAYMENT VALIDATION FAILED"
           END-IF.

       VALIDATE-PAYMENT.
           IF WS-PAYMENT-AMT > 0
               MOVE "OK" TO WS-STATUS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE "ER" TO WS-STATUS-CODE
           END-IF.

       APPLY-PAYMENT.
           DISPLAY "APPLYING PAYMENT OF $" WS-PAYMENT-AMT
           DISPLAY "FOR CUSTOMER: " WS-CUSTOMER-ID.

       END PROGRAM PAYMENT.
